==Description==
The '''Alien''' was the first [[Area 51]] [[Enemies|enemy]] that spawned in the event. The '''Alien''' had the same speed as the [[Normal]], but had more health than it. It is the weakest enemy that spawns in the [[Area 51 Event]].

==Appearance==
The '''Alien's''' appearance was similar to an extraterrestrial [[Enemies|enemy]]. It had a stereotypical green body with a rounded green alien head.

==Strategy==
*These are rather easy to kill, so [[Crook Boss]]es or [[Minigunner]]s can be used to kill these.
**A well placed [[Pyromancer]] can also kill this.
*Since they spawn in hordes, [[Rocketeer|Rocketer]]s and [[Demoman|Demomen]] can be used to kill these more quickly.

