==Trivia==
*The '''Alien''' is a reference to the Area 51 conspiracy theories speculating that the US Government is hiding extraterrestrial proof in the military base.
*The '''Alien's''' head was the {{RLinkC|20908888|Classic Alien}} accessory in the Roblox catalog.

